# The application library: well-known services, and what their traffic is.
# Adding one to an exit makes a group of it, which the person can change.
# It is a catalog for anyone, not one person's choices: nothing here goes
# anywhere until it is added to an exit.
#
# One application a line:  <id> | <name> | <icon> | <what it is> | <kind:value ...>
# The kinds are the rules language's: domain: full: keyword: cidr: set:
# process: path:. Values with spaces go in double quotes. A set is fetched
# when the application is added; the domains are listed as well, so that it
# works before, or without, the set.

claude      | Claude       | sparkles | 网页与桌面 App | domain:anthropic.com domain:claude.ai domain:claude.com domain:clau.de domain:claudeusercontent.com domain:claudemcpclient.com domain:claudemcpcontent.com cidr:160.79.104.0/21 process:Claude process:"Claude Helper" process:"Claude Helper (GPU)" process:"Claude Helper (Renderer)" process:"Claude Helper (Plugin)" set:geosite-anthropic
claude-code | Claude Code  | terminal | 命令行 | process:claude path:/\.local/share/claude/versions/
chatgpt     | ChatGPT      | sparkles | 网页与桌面 App | domain:openai.com domain:chatgpt.com domain:chat.com domain:sora.com domain:oaistatic.com domain:oaiusercontent.com process:ChatGPT set:geosite-openai
codex       | Codex        | terminal | 命令行 | process:codex
gemini      | Gemini       | sparkles | 网页与 AI Studio | domain:gemini.google.com domain:gemini.google domain:aistudio.google.com domain:generativelanguage.googleapis.com set:geosite-google-gemini
google      | Google       | globe    | 搜索、账号与全部 Google 服务 | domain:google.com domain:googleapis.com domain:gstatic.com domain:googleusercontent.com domain:ggpht.com domain:gvt1.com domain:gvt2.com domain:recaptcha.net set:geosite-google
grok        | Grok         | sparkles | 网页 | domain:x.ai domain:grok.com set:geosite-xai
perplexity  | Perplexity   | sparkles | 网页与 App | domain:perplexity.ai domain:pplx.ai process:Perplexity
cursor      | Cursor       | terminal | 编辑器 | domain:cursor.com domain:cursor.sh domain:cursorapi.com process:Cursor
github      | GitHub       | terminal | 代码与下载 | domain:github.com domain:githubusercontent.com domain:githubassets.com domain:github.io domain:ghcr.io set:geosite-github
huggingface | Hugging Face | terminal | 模型与数据集 | domain:huggingface.co domain:hf.co
youtube     | YouTube      | play     | 视频 | domain:youtube.com domain:youtu.be domain:googlevideo.com domain:ytimg.com domain:youtube-nocookie.com set:geosite-youtube
netflix     | Netflix      | play     | 视频 | domain:netflix.com domain:netflix.net domain:nflxvideo.net domain:nflximg.net domain:nflxext.com domain:nflxso.net set:geosite-netflix
spotify     | Spotify      | play     | 音乐 | domain:spotify.com domain:scdn.co domain:spotifycdn.com process:Spotify set:geosite-spotify
telegram    | Telegram     | command  | 消息 | domain:telegram.org domain:t.me domain:telegram.me process:Telegram set:geosite-telegram
discord     | Discord      | command  | 消息与语音 | domain:discord.com domain:discord.gg domain:discordapp.com domain:discordapp.net process:Discord set:geosite-discord
x           | X            | command  | 原 Twitter | domain:x.com domain:twitter.com domain:twimg.com domain:t.co set:geosite-twitter
wikipedia   | Wikipedia    | globe    | 百科 | domain:wikipedia.org domain:wikimedia.org
ip-check    | 出口查询     | globe    | 查看自己出口 IP 的网站 | full:api.ipify.org full:api-ipv4.ip.sb full:v4.ident.me domain:ipinfo.io domain:ip.sb
